HORAC;2;MGLD 00;Left=I,Right=P,Up=E,Down=Z,Return=N;E up:e,Y down:z,I left:i,P right:p,N jump:n,Space:Space,Esc:Escape;sipky = pohyb (E/Y/I/P), N = skok (podrzet), Space start (pad: A start, B skok - podrzet);P;
INVADERS;1;MGLD 00, JUMP 0100;Left Shift=End,Keypad +=PageDown,E=0,Z=1,H=2,I=3,Return=Space,Up=0,Down=1;Left:Left,Right:Right,Fast left:End,Fast right:PageDown,Fire:Space,0:0,1:1,2:2,3:3,Esc:Escape;sipky, End/PgDn rychle, Space (na dalkovem OK) strelba, 0-3 obtiznost, TV: jen obtiznost 0 (nahoru) a 1 (dolu);PR;
JASON;2;MGLD 00;Return=Space;Left:Left,Right:Right,Space:Space,Esc:Escape;mezera = menu/potvrdit, sipky vlevo/vpravo pohyb (pad: A, B nebo Start, TV: OK = mezera, text se nepise);PR;Textove adventury
