MINY;1;MGLD 0C;Up=End,E=End,Space=Up,H=PageUp,I=F2;Left:Left,Right:Right,Up:End,Down:Down,Open:Up,Flag:PageUp,Restart:F2,Start:Return,Esc:Escape;Miny (hledani min, Libor L.A. 2021, jen model 1 pro tento zavadec): menu L obtiznost, C barvy, M mys (602 neni), Enter start, I info, hra: sipky vlevo vpravo dolu, nahoru = sipka nahoru, Space otevre policko, H oznaci (CLR), F2 restart, Esc zpet do menu (pad: D-pad, A = otevrit, X = oznacit);P;
