SPINDIZZY;2A;MGLD 00;Up=Q,Down=A,Left=O,Right=P,E=Q,Z=A,H=N,I=M,Return=Space;Up:Q,Down:A,Left:O,Right:P,Fire:Space,Freeze:N,Map:m,Pause:t,Score:s,Shape:c,K0:F1,K1:F2,K2:F3,K3:F4,Esc:Escape;Spindizzy (Electric Dreams 1986, port RM-TEAM 2013, jen PMD 85-2A a 3): O vlevo, P vpravo, Q nahoru, A dolu, Space = start a zrychleni, N brzda, T pauza, M mapa, S skore (obtiznost, save, load), C tvar kulicky, F1-F4 otoceni pohledu, R zmena klaves, H napoveda (pad: D-pad, A = Space, X = N, Y = M);P;
HIGHENC;2A;MGLD 00;Left=O,Right=P,Up=Q,Down=A,E=Q,Z=A,I=5,Return=Space;Left:O,Right:P,Fast:Q,Slow:A,Fire:Space,Hold:H,Start:5,Info:3,Esc:Escape;Highway Encounter (Vortex Software 1985, port RM-TEAM 2016, jen PMD 85-2A a 3): v menu 5 = start, 1 klavesnice, 2 joystick, 3 informace, 4 ukazka, O vlevo, P vpravo, Q rychle, A pomalu, Space palba, H drzet, T a C konec hry (pad: D-pad, A = Space, X = H, Y = 5);P;
KUBANOID;1;MGLD 00;Left=O,Right=P,Up=Q,Down=A,E=Q,Z=A,I=S,Return=Space;Left:O,Right:P,Rotate up:Q,Rotate down:A,Drop:Space,Start:S,Esc:Escape;Kubanoid (Stardust 2025, port RM-TEAM a X-Agon 2026, logicka hra): menu S start, K klavesnice, J joystick, D definice klaves, F barvy, T terc, H hudba (MIF 85 neni), hra O vlevo, P vpravo, Q a A otaceni kostek, Space rychly pad (pad: D-pad, A = Space, Y = S);P;
STRIPPED;1;MGLD 03;Z=D,Down=D,Up=E;Up:e,Down:d,Fire:Space,1:1,2:2,3:3,4:4,Esc:Escape;E hore, D dole, Space strelba, menu cisly 1 ovladani, 2 start hry, 4 konec, 5 smazat rekord (po G chvili pocka na titulce);;
